{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07662","headline":"奉和刘采访缙云南岭作 · 庾光先","name":"奉和刘采访缙云南岭作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百越城池枕海圻，永嘉山水复相依。\n悬萝弱筱垂清浅，宿雨朝暾和翠微。\n鸟讶山经传不尽，花随月令数仍稀。\n幸陪谢客题诗句，谁与王孙此地归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庾光先","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07662.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07662","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗镜》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鏡_(四庫全書本)）"}